{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Upon you</b> — the meaning is \"Upon you I was cast,\" not upon Shaddai, my mother, for it is you who nourishes me and causes me to be nourished, and you who give me strength to receive until I grow; therefore he said: \"You are my El.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:11.243969822Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}